\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus, my life is from your life
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Jesus, you who died for me
\par You who gave up yourself for me
\par for fear, torture, even death
\par in my stead so am not condemned
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par so I would not die forever
\par Thousand times a thousand times
\par Jesus Lord I'll worship you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. You who allowed men to mock you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj abuse, disgrace, and: and curse you
\par canning, jeering, mocked and spat on
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 son of God the righteous one
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj who saved my soul from satan's chains
\par to enter into your glory.
\par Thousand times a thousand times
\par Jesus Lord I'll worship you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. By humility you've paid for
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   My arrogance laziness
\par   My self - conceitedness, cheating
\par   Haughtiness and indolence
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Your crown of thorns that was put on
\par    Will enable me to get crowned
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I am grateful to Thee Lord.
\par My good King, I'll praise Your name.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus for your life of sorrow
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Tormentation and strong thirst
\par For your stripes and
\par Your severe wounds
\par And your very bitter death,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj It is fitting that I bless Thee,
\par And submit myself unto Thee,
\par I am thankful, my Saviour
\par My good Lord, I praise your name.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

